<title>UK: Scholl yr pretax profit rises 13.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Scholl yr pretax profit rises 13.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		16.0		   vs 14.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.7		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 7.7		    vs 7.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     20.6		   vs 18.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   211.9		  vs 207.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British footwear specialist is Scholl Plc. The company said it expected a satisfactory outcome for the year.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
